## Command

```shell
biome migrate stylelint
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "enabled": true } }
```

## `.stylelintrc.json`

```json
{
        "rules": {
            "block-no-empty": true,
            "color-hex-case": "lower",
            "indentation": 2,
            "string-quotes": "double",
            "unicode-bom": "never"
        }
    }
```

